 * originally designed and implemented by Gustavo Fior (@gustavo-fior) and co-founder
 * Abdul Haidar at Foglamp Labs (https://foglamp.dev).
 * Apache-2.0 Section 4(b) Registry Packaging Notice: Tailrocks modified comments and/or imports or assets for registry distribution.
